Description: Cross-platform media portal and processing toolkit
 FluxMedia is a media manager, automated downloader and local streaming
 gateway with a terminal application and web interface. It downloads
 video, audio, playlists and subtitles via yt-dlp, post-processes with
 FFmpeg, and shares files over the LAN with a password-protected HTTP
 server and QR-code access.
 .
 Launch with `fluxmedia`, the web dashboard with `fluxmedia --web`,
 or the Textual TUI with `fluxmedia --tui`.
